/**
 * Design tokens: the single source of truth for web (Tailwind 4 theme CSS,
 * generated by scripts/build-css.ts) and mobile (imported directly).
 *
 * PROVISIONAL: an original, friendly, high-contrast palette in the spirit of the
 * ClassDojo benchmark (rounded, bright, playful) without copying its brand.
 * The designer replaces these values in Implementation Plan step M0.5.
 *
 * Keep this file free of imports and non-erasable TypeScript syntax: it is also
 * executed directly by Node's type stripping in the build script.
 */

